# GUARDRAIL AKTİF — savunma-only, secret-redakte, exploit-yok

# Security File Structure (Bölüm 12)

Türkçe not: Her fazın çıktısı sabit klasöre yazılır. Additive — mevcut `components/**`, `data/**` corpus'una dokunma.

## Canonical tree (security-namespaced)
- `SECURITY_CONTEXT/` — `inventory.md`, `attack-surface.md`.
- `SECURITY_RESEARCH/` — research notes + `README.md`.
- `TASKS/security-master.md` — security work breakdown.
- `ORG/ROLES/` — 40+ security role titles (Bölüm 5: C-level → SOC).
- `EXPERTS/` — `SECURITY_DIGEST.md` + README (monthly READ→DELTA→DIFF→WRITE→DIGEST; seeds to-verify).
- `LAYERS/` `FIREWALLS/` `ENCRYPTION/` `CHANGE/` `TRANSPARENT_CODE/` `CONDITIONAL/` — 6×100 control frameworks (schema + template rows; see `20-control-mapping`).
- `SECURITY_MATRIX/matrix.md` — cross-map schema + standards list (Bölüm 8).
- `IMPLEMENTATION/` `ASSESSMENTS/` `COMPLIANCE/` — rollout, gap assessments, ISO 27001 SoA stub.
- `CALENDAR/` `QA/` `MEMORY/` `REPORTS/` `ARCHIVE/` — cadence, findings, memory, reports, archive.
- `SECURITY_STATE.md` — source of truth (Faz + MODE). `.cursor/plans/security-master-plan.md` — Faz 0..8.

## Conventions
- Docs `UPPER_SNAKE.md` or kebab; command/skill folders kebab-case; dates `YYYY-MM-DD`.
- Never overwrite existing artifacts silently; append or version.
- Do not commit `node_modules/`, `__pycache__/`, `*.pyc`, `*.log`, or secret files.
